16A6 9035             (       circle.asm):00135                         SUBA    <C_ST
16A8 2802             (       circle.asm):00136                         BVC     RD_6
16AA 8680             (       circle.asm):00137                         LDA     #-128
16AC 1F89             (       circle.asm):00138         RD_6            TFR     A,B
